<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113301" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χᾰμηλός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>on the ground, creeping,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					944
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίτυς χ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαμαίπιτυς</span>
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				841
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					70.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>low,</i>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθαμαλός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				10.2.12
			</span></i>; of a horse's hoofs, <i>flat,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>diminutive, trifling,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στιγμῆς εἴ τι -ότερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.472.4
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαμηλὰ πνέων</span> one of a
				<i>low</i> spirit, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				11.30
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
